Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.53,0:00:05.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,大伙们  你们一定不会相信\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey, hey! Guys, you won't believe this!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.74,0:00:08.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我刚刚接到经纪人的电话  我的天啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I just got off the phone with my agent. Oh, my God!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.83,0:00:13.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对不起  太突然了  你说吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm sorry. Too soon. You go. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.62,0:00:16.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我因为《我们的日子》被提名\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I got nominated for my part on Days of Our Lives!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.25,0:00:19.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,喔  乔伊  真是太好了  恭喜你\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, Joey, good for you! Congratulations!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.09,0:00:22.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不敢相信你获得艾美奖提名  不  不是\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I can't believe you're nominated for an Emmy! No, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.13,0:00:26.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,肥皂剧文摘奖  不  我被提名"肥皂奖"\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Soap Opera Digest Award? Nope, I'm up for a "Soapie."
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.89,0:00:31.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,甜心  那是你乱编的吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Honey, is that something you're making up?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.68,0:00:36.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不  那是真的  这个奖从1998年设立就开始颁发\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No, no, no, it's real! And it has been since 1998.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.73,0:00:39.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿  瑞秋  我被提名肥皂奖了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey, Rach, Rach. I'm up for a Soapie!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.98,0:00:42.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我的天啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, my God!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.19,0:00:46.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,天啊  那是排名第三的肥皂剧大奖\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, my God! That is like the third most prestigious soap opera award there is!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.03,0:00:50.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢  我猜我们应该知道  该带谁参加颁奖典礼了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Thank you! Well, I guess now we know who I'm taking to the awards.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.08,0:00:54.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,别跟我开这种玩笑  所有明星都会去吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, stop that! Don't kid about that! Will all the stars be there?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.45,0:00:56.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,很多人都说他们会去\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Many are scheduled to appear.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.62,0:00:58.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我的天啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.83,0:01:02.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,天啊  我不能去  我一定会太紧张  那换我去吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, my God. I can't go. I'll be too nervous! Okay, I'll go.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.75,0:01:05.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不行  你要结婚了  这个机会是我的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No! You are getting married. This is all I have.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.34,0:01:09.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,老友记  第七季  第18集  乔伊获奖\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Friends  S07E18  The One With Joey's Award
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.35,0:01:15.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,主演: 珍妮佛·安妮斯顿
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.77,0:01:18.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,主演: 寇妮·考克斯
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.10,0:01:22.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,主演: 丽莎·库卓
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.03,0:01:29.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,主演: 麦特·勒布兰
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.32,0:01:32.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,主演: 马修·派瑞
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.62,0:01:35.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,主演: 大卫·修蒙
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.80,0:01:52.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,恩斯特穆伯拉特假设  迅猛龙受到威胁时\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And Ernest Muhlbrat who first hypothesized that the velociraptor, when threatened...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.26,0:01:56.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他会把颈部肌肉张开  发出尖锐的叫声\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...would expand its collar and emit a high-pitched noise...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.39,0:01:58.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,将敌人吓跑\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...to frighten off its predator.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.64,0:01:59.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,路易斯  什么事\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yes, Mr. Lewis?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.56,0:02:02.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他是怎么叫的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What kind of noise?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.73,0:02:06.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他会发出尖锐吵杂的声音\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Just a high-pitched, intimidating noise.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.53,0:02:09.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那到底是什么声音啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}But like how?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.82,0:02:12.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们不是很清楚\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, we-we don't know for sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.53,0:02:17.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但我想  应该是这样的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}But in my head, it sounded something like this, uh:
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.01,0:02:34.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,当然了  这只是一种推测\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Of course, this is just conjecture.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.31,0:02:38.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好了  今天的课就上到这里\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Ahem, okay. That's, uh, That's all for today.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.35,0:02:43.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,摩斯先生  我能跟你谈谈吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Mr. Morse, can I see you for a moment?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.36,0:02:47.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好的  先生\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yes, sir?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.69,0:02:51.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,摩斯先生  我得跟你谈谈你的期中考成绩\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Mr. Morse, I need to talk to you about your mid-term exam.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.28,0:02:56.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,恐怕我不能让你及格了   为什么\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm afraid I had to fail you. Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.91,0:02:59.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你得答对60%才能过关\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, you need 6O percent to pass.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.41,0:03:01.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我得了几分   7分\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What'd I get? Seven.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.79,0:03:05.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不算太好\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}That's not so good.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.84,0:03:08.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不  不好  太糟了  奈德  到底怎么回事\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No, no, it's not. What happened there, Ned?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.46,0:03:14.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,或许你可以放我一马  我恋爱了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, maybe you can cut me some slack. I'm sort of in love.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.14,0:03:18.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,很抱歉  但那真的不是我的问题\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well I'm sorry, but that's really not my problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.72,0:03:20.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我爱上了你\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm in love with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.52,0:03:25.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这好像又跟我有一点关系了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, that brings me in the loop a little.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.15,0:03:30.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,看么  这就是我考砸的原因  我没办法专心上课\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}See, that's why I did so bad on this test. I'm having a hard time concentrating.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.90,0:03:33.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你站在讲台上讲课的时候\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}When you're up there and you're teaching...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.82,0:03:36.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,表情是那么地严肃\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...and your face gets all serious...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.87,0:03:41.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你看起来好帅  当你穿着紧身套头毛衣时\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...you look so good. When you wear that tight little turtleneck sweater--
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.00,0:03:44.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay. Ned, um--
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.92,0:03:49.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我是你的老师  对不起\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I, uh-Ha, ha. I'm your teacher. I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.17,0:03:50.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你是学生\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You're-You're a student.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.13,0:03:53.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,而且我喜欢女人\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And I-And I like women, ha, ha.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.51,0:03:56.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不管别人在一些椅子的背后写的些什么\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}In spite of what may be written on the backs of some of these chairs.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.72,0:04:02.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,天啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.93,0:04:05.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,吧台那个男人在看你\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}That guy at the counter is totally checking you out.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.56,0:04:07.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真的吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.73,0:04:11.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我的天啊  他真的好帅  过去泡他\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, my God, he's really cute. Heh. Go for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.28,0:04:14.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,菲比  我订婚了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Phoebe, I'm engaged.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.20,0:04:16.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我是说让你问问他的电话号码  以防万一\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm just saying, get his number, just in case.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.32,0:04:22.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,要是钱德发生什么意外  丧失了性能力\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}But if Chandler is in an accident and can't perform sexually, you know...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.79,0:04:27.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他可能要你找个情人  满足他无法满足你的那个部分\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...then he would want you to take a lover to satisfy the needs he can no longer fulfill.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.63,0:04:31.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嗨  喔\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hi. I-Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.30,0:04:34.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我是不是应该先告诉你\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Can I just tell you something? Um--
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.09,0:04:38.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我真的受宠若惊  但我订婚了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm very flattered, but, uh, I'm engaged. Ha, ha.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.30,0:04:42.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这还真是有点尴尬\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Wow, uh-This is kind of embarrassing.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.43,0:04:45.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但实际上  我是想过来跟你朋友打个招呼\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I was actually coming over to talk to your friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.81,0:04:49.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你是该感到尴尬的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, you should be embarrassed.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.32,0:04:58.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我以为你知道我在看你  我知道  真的很好玩\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I thought you knew I was looking at you. I did, but that was really fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.07,0:05:02.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,"得奖的是乔伊崔比亚尼"\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}"The winner is Joey Tribbiani!"
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.54,0:05:09.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,哇\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}"Oh, wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.92,0:05:12.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,"我真的没想到我会得奖\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I honestly never expected this. I, uh--
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.80,0:05:14.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我没有准备演讲稿\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I didn't prepare a speech.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.84,0:05:19.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我要谢谢我的父母  他们一直支持着我\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}But I'd like to thank my parents, who've always been there for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.39,0:05:24.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我还要谢谢我的朋友  钱德  摩妮卡  菲比  瑞秋"\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Also like to thank my friends, Chandler, Monica, Phoebe, Rachel--"
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.68,0:05:26.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我排在第四名  天啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm fourth? Jeez!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.56,0:05:31.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,看看你  拿着你的枫糖奖\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Look at you with your little maple syrup award!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.44,0:05:33.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,拜托你不要告诉别人这件事\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah may-maybe you don't tell anyone about this.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.52,0:05:34.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么  不\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What? No.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.90,0:05:37.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这没有什么大不了的  我也会拿着洗发精的瓶子那么做\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It's not a big deal. I do that too, with my shampoo bottle.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.07,0:05:39.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真的吗  没错\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Really? Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.28,0:05:42.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你练习的是什么奖  葛莱美奖\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What award are you practicing for? Grammy.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.87,0:05:46.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我是最佳新进艺人\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Best New Artist. Ooh.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.00,0:05:50.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,肥皂奖的人今天打电话给我  我还得上台颁奖\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, hey, listen. The Soapies people called today and I also get to present an award.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.00,0:05:52.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,太好了  对啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Aw, that's great. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.63,0:05:55.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,所以就算你没得奖  你也有机会上台\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}So you'll definitely get on stage even if you don't win.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.51,0:06:01.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你认为我不会得奖  你当然会得奖\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You-You don't think I'm gonna win? Of course I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.72,0:06:06.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但最受欢迎的死而后生奖  竞争很激烈\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}But, you know, Favorite Returning Character is a tough category, Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.77,0:06:10.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我是说你要跟一个从火葬场死里逃生的家伙竞争\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I mean, you're up against the guy who survived his own cremation.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.77,0:06:14.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是的  我知道或许可能会输  只是\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah. No, I know I might not win. But it's just...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.07,0:06:18.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我从来没获得过提名  我太想得到这个奖了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I've never even been nominated before. I want it so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.24,0:06:19.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,乔伊  或许你会得奖\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well Joey, and you'll probably get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.03,0:06:23.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但你应该开始练习  万一失败了应该有得体的表现\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}But you should probably start practicing your "gracious-loser" face.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.95,0:06:27.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,当摄影机拍到你时  你得表现出失望的样子\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Y'know when like, the cameras are on you and you wanna look disappointed...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.41,0:06:30.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但也得表现出对方是  实至名归的表情  就像这样\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...but also that your colleague deserved to win. Y'know? So it's sorta like...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.13,0:06:37.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你知道吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey. You know?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.38,0:06:43.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你也练习过失去格莱美奖  不  拿格莱美奖我从不失手\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You practice losing at the Grammys too? Oh, no, at the Grammys, I always win.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.56,0:06:51.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿  你跟杰克约会还顺利吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, hey. Hey. How'd your date go with Jake?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.27,0:06:53.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,太棒了  我们整晚一直注视着彼此\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, great! We couldn't keep our eyes off each other all night.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.11,0:06:59.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,每一次那个  你知道  他都俯下身来抚摸我的头发跟脖子\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Then every once and a while y'know, he'd lean over and stroke my hair, and then touch my neck.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.53,0:07:02.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  别这样  菲比  你让我浑身发麻\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay, stop it. Phoebe, You're getting me all tingly.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.20,0:07:06.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我只能想着  他要吻我了吗  要吻我了吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}All I could think of was, y'know, "Is he gonna kiss me? Is he gonna kiss me?"
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.45,0:07:09.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他吻了你吗  我是个淑女啊  摩尼卡  我接吻的时候不说话\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And did he? I'm a lady, Monica. I don't kiss and tell.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.37,0:07:11.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但这个吻痕说明了一切\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}But this hickey speaks for itself.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.87,0:07:13.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好了  我知道了  我知道了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay, okay, I got it. I got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.33,0:07:17.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我真的好喜欢他  感觉上像是我今天喝了十杯酒\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I just like him so much that I just feel like I've had 1O drinks today.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.09,0:07:20.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,而我只喝了六杯\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And I've only had six.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.47,0:07:26.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我第一次跟钱德约会后  就再也没有那样的感觉了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh. You know, I haven't had that feeling since I first starting going out with Chandler.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.93,0:07:31.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我永远都不会再有那样的感觉了  你的口气像个男人\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Wow, I'm never gonna have that feeling again am I? You sound like a guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.52,0:07:35.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不  男人会说 "我永远都不能再跟别人上床了"\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Heh. No, a guy would be saying, "I'm never gonna get to sleep with anyone else." Heh.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.73,0:07:38.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我永远都不能再跟别人上床了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, my God. I'm never gonna sleep with anyone else!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.73,0:07:43.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我一直忙着筹备婚礼  完全忘了我要放弃什么\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I've been so busy planning the wedding, I forgot about all the things that I'd be giving up.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.99,0:07:47.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我再也不会有初吻\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I mean, I'm never gonna have a first kiss again.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.28,0:07:50.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你会有最后的吻别\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You'll have a last kiss.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.75,0:07:59.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我能问你一件事吗  有男人喜欢过你吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Can I ask you something? You ever had a guy have a crush on you?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.34,0:08:01.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那就是你要帮我打领带的原因\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Is that why you wanted to tie my tie?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.38,0:08:06.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我班上的学生说他爱上我了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}There's this kid in my class who said he's in love with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.05,0:08:08.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,哇\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Whoa! Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.30,0:08:10.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,哇  什么  罗斯有男朋友了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Whoa, what? Ross has a boyfriend.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.72,0:08:13.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我没有男朋友\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I do-I do not have a boyfriend.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.94,0:08:17.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我班上有个男学生暗恋我\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}There's a guy in one of my classes who has a crush on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.15,0:08:19.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真的吗  对  我不知道\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Really? Yeah. I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.94,0:08:22.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,去年是伊莉莎白  现在是这个孩子\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I mean, last year, Elizabeth, now this kid...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.82,0:08:26.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这是怎么回事啊  难道是我浑身散发出\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What-What-What is it? Am I giving out some kind of...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.82,0:08:29.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,一股性感教授的气质吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...a sexy-professor vibe?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.33,0:08:34.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,现在看起来不像\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Not right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.50,0:08:39.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,重点是我的天生丽质  让他期中考试不及格\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It-it—The point is, my natural charisma has made him fail his midterm.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.84,0:08:41.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我替那个孩子感到难过\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Aw, see now I feel bad for the kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.09,0:08:45.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我也曾经暗恋过老师  那个真的很难受\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I had a crush on a teacher once, and it was so hard, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.55,0:08:50.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我没办法专心上课  每次他看着我时  我都会脸红\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I couldn't concentrate and I blushed every time he looked at me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.22,0:08:53.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你还记得19岁时的恋爱滋味吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Come on, you remember what it's like to be 19 and in love.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.10,0:08:58.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我是可以放他一马  太棒了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah, guess I can cut him some slack. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.69,0:09:01.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你怎么忘记那个老师的  我没有\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}How'd you get over that teacher? I didn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.90,0:09:04.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我跟他上床了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I got under him.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.53,0:09:06.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,问题解决了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Problem solved.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.49,0:09:12.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,再见  菲比  好的  再见\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Bye,Phoebe. Okay, bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.25,0:09:22.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好的  再见  再见\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}All right. Bye. Bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.63,0:09:31.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们在门口说再见  不想太招摇\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}We said goodbye at the door so as not to flaunt our new love.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.89,0:09:34.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,菲比  没关系  你不必顾虑到我\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Phoebe, it's okay. You don't have to tip toe around me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.68,0:09:38.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我已经想过了  你知道吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I've been thinking about it, and um-You know what?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.19,0:09:40.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我可以接受没有心动感觉的恋爱生活\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm okay about not having that new-relationship feeling.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.31,0:09:44.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我已经开始想你了  我也会想你\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I miss you already! I miss you too!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.36,0:09:52.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,看见了  这就是我说的  真的太棒了  但我不会拿我的幸福跟你交换\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}See, that's what I mean. I mean that, That's great, but I wouldn't trade in what I have for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.83,0:09:55.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我会一辈子跟钱德相守\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I mean, I'm gonna be with Chandler for the rest of my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.95,0:09:57.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那会让我觉得幸福\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}That's what makes me happy. Mm-hm.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.08,0:10:02.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嗨  亲爱的  过来  过来坐这  我和菲比正在谈\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey, sweetie, come here, Come sit down. Hey Phoebe and I were just talking about how our relationship is...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.96,0:10:05.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们的关系有多深厚  多有意义  真的是那样  你觉得呢\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...deep and meaningful. It really is, don't you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.71,0:10:07.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,喔  绝对是\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, totally.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.30,0:10:09.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,拉一下我的手指\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Pull my finger.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.31,0:10:18.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,最受欢迎死而复生男演员\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Presenting the award for Favorite Returning Male Character is McKensize...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.68,0:10:20.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,来了  轮到我了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}This is it. This is my category!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.81,0:10:22.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你的演讲稿带了吗  带了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Got your speech? Got my speech.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.48,0:10:24.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,失败者得体的表情练习好了吗  这样\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Got your gracious-loser face? Yep.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.94,0:10:29.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,记住  乔伊  如果你得奖了  你得抱我  抱我\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Now, Joey, remember, if you win, you have to hug me. You hug me!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.49,0:10:32.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好  我能捏你的屁股吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay. Can I squeeze your ass?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.62,0:10:35.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,在电视上吗  对\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}On TV? Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.37,0:10:37.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,可以  好\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.75,0:10:41.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,在最受欢迎死而复生  男演员奖方面被提名的有\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}In the category of Favorite Returning Male Character, the nominees are:
