Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.84,0:10:49.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,盖文葛拉罕  《年少轻狂》\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Gavin Graham from The Young and the Restless.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.84,0:10:53.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,唐肯哈灵顿  《热情》\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Duncan Harrington from Passions.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.51,0:10:57.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,乔伊崔比亚尼  《我们的日子》\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And Joey Tribbiani from Days of Our Lives.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.47,0:11:01.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,得奖的是\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And the Soapie goes to:
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.81,0:11:04.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,盖文葛拉罕  《年少轻狂》\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Gavin Graham from The Young and the Restless.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.27,0:11:06.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,搞什么\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What the?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.04,0:11:20.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,颁发最受欢迎女配角奖的是\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Presenting the award for Favorite Supporting Actress award:
