Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.84,0:11:38.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,得奖都是实至名归  可惜只有一个人能得奖\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...deserves to take it home. Unfortunately, only one can.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.68,0:11:44.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,最受欢迎女配角奖被提名的有\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}The nominees for Favorite Supporting Actress are:
