Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.28,0:11:53.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,《一生一次》  玛丽墨琳毕雪\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}From One Life to Live, Mary Lauren Bishop.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.61,0:11:55.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,《我的孩子们》  莎拉蕾妮\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}From All My Children, Sarah Renee.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.03,0:11:59.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,《我们的日子》  洁西卡艾许丽\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And from Days of Our Lives, Jessica Ashley.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.20,0:12:01.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,得奖的是\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And the winner is:
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.08,0:12:04.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,洁西卡艾许丽  《我们的日子》\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Jessica Ashley from Days of Our Lives.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.04,0:12:09.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,很不幸  洁西卡今晚因故无法出席\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Uh, unfortunately, Jessica couldn't be with us tonight...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.09,0:12:12.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我要代表她接受这个奖\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...so I'll be accepting this award on her behalf.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.47,0:12:19.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我相信洁西卡\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And I'm sure that Jessica...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.60,0:12:21.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,也会谢谢我的父母\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...would like to thank my parents...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.85,0:12:23.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,因为他们一直都很支持我\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...who always believed in me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.10,0:12:26.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她也会感谢我的朋友\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And she'd also like to thank my friends:
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.60,0:12:30.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,钱德  摩妮卡  罗斯  菲比跟瑞秋\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Chandler, Monica, Ross, Phoebe and Rachel...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.15,0:12:33.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她就坐在那边\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...who's sitting right there.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.75,0:12:47.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,乔伊  我们为什么要急着离开\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Joey, why did we have to rush out of there so fast?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.96,0:12:49.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们是得赶快离开  因为\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}We had to get out of there because--
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.09,0:12:52.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你看我拿了什么回家\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Look what I won! Ha-ha-ha.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.88,0:12:57.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我的天啊  你偷走她的奖杯\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, my God. You stole her award.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.47,0:13:01.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不  我代表她收下它\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No, no, no. I'm accepting it on her behalf.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.47,0:13:04.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,乔伊  我想你不知道"代表"是什么意思\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Joey I don't think you know what "behalf" means.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.93,0:13:09.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我当然知道  它是个动词  意思是"我能分一半"\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Sure I do. It's a verb. As in "I be half-in' it"!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.48,0:13:12.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,乔伊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Joey"
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.15,0:13:17.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你得把它还回去  凭什么啊  我应该得奖的  我好想得奖\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You have got to take this back. But why?! I should've won one. I really wanted it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.82,0:13:22.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她根本不在乎才没有出席  它也可以拿来当葛莱美\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}She didn't even care enough to come to the thing. It could also be a Grammy.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.16,0:13:27.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不  乔伊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No, Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.37,0:13:31.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,拜托  瑞秋  没有人看到我把它拿走  整个桌子上都是奖杯\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Come on, Rach. No one saw me take it. There was a whole table full of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.38,0:13:33.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你想要一个不属于你的奖杯吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Do you really want an award that you didn't win?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.09,0:13:37.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不  我当然想要一个属于我的奖杯  可是没人愿意让我得奖\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No, I want an award I did win. But nobody's given me any of those!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.43,0:13:43.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如果我把它摆在这里  大家就会看到它\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Plus, look, hey, Rach. lf l put it up there right? when people come over, they'll see it...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.51,0:13:45.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,以为我真的得奖了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...and they'll think I won it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.22,0:13:48.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,乔伊  上面写着"最佳女配角奖"\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Joey, it says "Best Supporting Actress."
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.81,0:13:50.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我可以把那个刮掉\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I can scratch that right off.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.94,0:13:54.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,乔伊  这样是不对的  你得把它还回去\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Joey, no, this is wrong. You have to take it back.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.53,0:13:59.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你不会想这样把奖杯拿回家  你真的有演戏天分\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay? You don't wanna win an award this way. You're very talented.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.70,0:14:04.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有一天你会真的得奖  那对你来说才有意义\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And someday you're gonna win one of these for real and that one is gonna mean something.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.08,0:14:09.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  好吗  谢谢\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, all right. All right? Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.13,0:14:14.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我明天就把它还回去  谢谢\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'll take it back tomorrow. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.35,0:14:28.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如果我不能拥有它  你也不能拥有它\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}If I can't have it, you can't have it! Aah!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.52,0:14:38.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,盖勒教授  是的  路易斯  有什么能帮忙吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Professor Geller? Yes, Mr. Lewis? How can I help you?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.74,0:14:41.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我知道我的期中考没有考好\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I know I didn't do well on my midterms and stuff...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.99,0:14:45.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但我希望你能帮我改成绩\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...but I was kind of hoping you could change my grade.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.70,0:14:48.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我为什么要那么做\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And why exactly would I do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.95,0:14:50.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,因为我爱上你了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Because I'm in love with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.38,0:14:55.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.50,0:14:59.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对  因为我爱上你了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah. I'm all in love with you and stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.47,0:15:04.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你可以帮我改成绩吗  不行\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}So could you change my grade? No!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.26,0:15:07.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,为什么你帮奈德改成绩\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, why not? You changed Ned's grade.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.51,0:15:11.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那不一样  因为他真的爱上我了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, that's different, okay? Because he was actually in love with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.85,0:15:15.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不  他才没有呢  他只是在耍你\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No, he's not! He's totally yanking your chain.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.27,0:15:17.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他已经用这一招对付过其他三个教授了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}He's done this with three other teachers.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.61,0:15:21.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么  他有女朋友\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What? He's got a girlfriend.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.53,0:15:26.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不敢相信有人会为了成绩那么做\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I can't believe someone would do that for a grade.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.78,0:15:28.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我知道\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.33,0:15:29.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那太可怕了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It's awful.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.66,0:15:32.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我爱你\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I love you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.96,0:15:38.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你看到钱德了吗  没有  干嘛\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Have you seen Chandler? No, why?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.05,0:15:42.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,因为我一直在想  我会失去的一切\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}'Cause I just keep thinking about all these things I'm not gonna have...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.42,0:15:45.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我真的吓坏了  我不知道该怎么办\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...and it's freaking me out. I don't know what to do about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.47,0:15:46.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,别担心\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay. Don't sweat it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.01,0:15:51.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,钱德不在  别管那么多规矩了  那个男的很帅\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Chandler is nowhere around, so go ahead get it out of your system. That guy's cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.31,0:15:54.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,菲比  别这样  我是认真的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Phoebe, come on, I'm serious.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.65,0:16:00.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我得跟他谈这件事  不  这是你最后的选择\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I've just gotta talk to him about all this. No that is the last thing you wanna do.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.07,0:16:04.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,为什么  因为你要嫁给他\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Why? Because you're marrying him!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.28,0:16:07.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你得说清楚  菲比\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You gotta help me out here, Pheebs.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.78,0:16:11.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我从来没有订过婚  也没有真正结过婚\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}All right, I've never been engaged and I've never really been married.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.33,0:16:14.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我只能告诉你我妈跟我说的话\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}But I can only tell you what my mother told me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.16,0:16:18.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,当你对一段关系有疑虑  害怕或焦虑时\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Whenever you have doubts or fears or anxieties about a relationship...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.59,0:16:21.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,别跟你的丈夫沟通这些问题\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...do not communicate them to your husband.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.01,0:16:26.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,所以  我不该跟我要共度一生的男人\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}So I'm not supposed to share my doubts and fears...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.84,0:16:29.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,分享我的疑虑跟恐惧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...with the guy I'm spending the rest of my life with?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.51,0:16:31.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没错  就是那样\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}That is correct. Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.81,0:16:35.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你应该把那件事放在心里\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You're supposed to take all of that stuff and put it in a little box in your mind...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.52,0:16:37.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,永远不再提\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...and then lock it up tight.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.19,0:16:40.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那是你妈妈告诉你的  对\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Your mother told you this? Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.44,0:16:44.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那个结了很多次婚  在你十三岁时就自杀了的女人\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}The woman that got married a bunch of times and killed herself when you were 13?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.07,0:16:47.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我的天啊  你说的对\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, my God, you're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.82,0:16:50.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,去啊  去告诉钱德  快点  免得太迟了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Go! Go tell Chandler. Hurry, before it's too late!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.99,0:16:55.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,等一下  这是不是说你对做爱不感兴趣了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Wait, no! Does this also mean that putting out doesn't get you love?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.88,0:17:00.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,（银杯）
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.09,0:17:04.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不敢相信我要跟洁西卡艾许丽碰面  等下  等下\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I can't believe I'm gonna meet Jessica Ashley! Wait, wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.72,0:17:07.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,瑞秋  冷静一点  好吗  我跟这个女人一起工作\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Please be cool, okay? I work with this woman.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.09,0:17:10.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  我会很冷静的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay, I'm totally cool. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.10,0:17:12.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,请进\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Come in.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.72,0:17:14.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿  洁西卡\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey, Jessica.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.02,0:17:16.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿  洁西\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey, Jess.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.52,0:17:18.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她是我朋友瑞秋\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Ah, this is my friend Rachel.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.90,0:17:21.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嗨  你好吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hi. What's up?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.53,0:17:27.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这是你的肥皂奖  我代表你收下了它\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Uh, listen, here's your Soapie. I accepted it for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.61,0:17:31.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我的天啊  我得奖了  你知道这代表什么吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, my God. I won? Do you have any idea what this means?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.83,0:17:38.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就这样么  你不打算  你不把它摆在柜子里或者其他什么上吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, that-that-that's it? You're gonna, you're not gonna put it on your shelf or anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.37,0:17:43.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不  我只想把真正的奖杯摆在柜子里  对不起\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No, I try to save that for real awards. Now if you'll excuse me?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.96,0:17:47.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,要把它拿回去吗  那当然\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Take it back? Absolutely.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.06,0:17:55.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对  做得好\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah, you do.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.48,0:18:00.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,甜心  我们快结婚了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Honey? As we get closer to the wedding... Hm?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.73,0:18:03.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有什么事你想跟我分享吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...Is there anything you'd like to talk about or share?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.57,0:18:07.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  我觉得桌上的装饰太大了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay. Well, I think the centerpieces are too big.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.65,0:18:09.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你错了  桌上的装饰刚刚好\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You're wrong. The centerpieces are fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.82,0:18:16.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你害怕过吗  有点  它们真的很大\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Do you ever get scared at all? Kind of. They're really big.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.04,0:18:23.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你不害怕自己再也不会有新的浪漫关系了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Doesn't it ever freak you out that you're never gonna be with anybody new again?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.96,0:18:25.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.63,0:18:26.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,只是\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Just--
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.84,0:18:29.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我非常爱你  只是\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I love you so much. Just--
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.63,0:18:33.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有时候我会很难过  我无法再有那样的感觉\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It's just sometimes it bothers me that I'm never gonna have that feeling.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.51,0:18:35.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,当你刚认识一个人\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}When you first meet someone for the first time...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.97,0:18:40.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你会觉得新鲜刺激  你知道那种心动的感觉吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...and it's new and exciting. You know that rush?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.10,0:18:41.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不知道\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.52,0:18:44.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不  当我刚认识一个人\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No, see, when I first meet somebody...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.48,0:18:49.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我会觉得慌张  焦虑  满头大汗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...it's mostly panic, anxiety and a great deal of sweating.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.28,0:18:53.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  但你是男人\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay, but-All right, you're a guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.49,0:18:57.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你不害怕你永远不能再跟别人上床了吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Does it not freak you out that you're never gonna sleep with anybody else?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.83,0:19:00.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,跟别人上床  不\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Sleeping with somebody, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.37,0:19:04.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我害怕的是焦虑  慌张  跟满头大汗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Anxiety, panic and I'm afraid even more sweating.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.84,0:19:07.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,即使是跟我在一起\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Even with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.21,0:19:11.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们刚开始交往的六个月  我严重脱水\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I was dangerously dehydrated during the first six months of our relationship.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.22,0:19:18.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对我来说心动的感觉就是  我们会共度余生\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Look, for me the rush is knowing that we are gonna be together for the rest of our lives.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.60,0:19:21.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真的吗  对\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Really? Well, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.98,0:19:27.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,知道你有这些想法  我们又回到了慌张  焦虑跟\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}But now that I know that you're having these thoughts, we're back to panic, anxiety and, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.48,0:19:30.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我真的需要喝点运动饮料\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...I'm definitely gonna need some kind of sports drink.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.28,0:19:32.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,过来\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Come here.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.70,0:19:36.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,过来  甜心  你不必担心\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Come here. Oh, sweetie, you don't have to worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.62,0:19:41.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,而且你知道吗  跟你在一起  我一定能遇上新鲜的事\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No. Besides, you know what? I'm gonna have a lot of new things with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.37,0:19:45.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们第一次买房子  第一个孩子  第一个孙子\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}The first time we buy a house, our first kid, our first grandkid.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.13,0:19:48.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,给我水  水  水\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Water. Water. Water.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.55,0:19:53.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,摩斯先生我能跟你谈谈吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Uh, Mr. Morse? Can I speak to you for a moment?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.39,0:19:59.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你今天上课的内容很精彩\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}That was a great lecture today.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.60,0:20:00.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你剪了头发吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Did you get a haircut? Mm-hm.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.06,0:20:04.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,对  你喜欢吗  你爱吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah, yeah. Do you like it? Do you love it?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.44,0:20:09.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我要告诉你  我会把你的成绩改回来\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I want you to know that I'm changing your grade back.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.27,0:20:11.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么  为什么\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What? Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.03,0:20:15.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我知道你在搞什么鬼  这不管用\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Because I know what you're trying to pull here. It's not gonna work.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.82,0:20:20.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我没有搞什么鬼  听着  我爱你\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm not trying to pull anything. Look, I love you, dude.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.29,0:20:25.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我甚至不想谈这件事了  这个小"风流韵事"结束了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You know what, I'm not even gonna talk about this. This little "thing" is over.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.67,0:20:30.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我知道你有女朋友  也知道其他教授的事\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I know you have a girlfriend. Yeah. And I know about the other professors.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.80,0:20:34.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你知道我什么感觉吗  你利用我\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}How do you think that makes me feel, Ned? You used me!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.59,0:20:36.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你不爱我  你从来都没有爱过我\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You don't love me and you never did!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.18,0:20:42.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,温斯顿教授  佛迪瑞克森教授\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Ah, Professor Winston. Professor Frederickson.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.06,0:20:47.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我马上来\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'll be right with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.52,0:20:50.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,别把这事搞砸了  我会给你"C"   我们可以走了吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Don't make this worse and I'll give you a C. Shall we?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.11,0:20:58.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,瑞秋\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Rash'?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.32,0:21:01.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我马上来\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'll be out in a second. Hm.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.87,0:21:07.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,"这真的是太意外了  我\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}"It's just so unexpected! I--
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.59,0:21:14.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我得告诉大家  能被提名诺贝尔奖\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'll tell you, it's just such an honor to just be nominated...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.97,0:21:17.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,已经是莫大的光荣了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...for a Nobel Prize.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.64,0:21:23.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我竟然因为按摩得了诺贝尔奖\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And, you know, to win one for a massage! Oh...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.81,0:21:27.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,特别是我刚拿下  东尼奖的最佳女演员奖"\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Especially after having just won a Tony Award for Best Actress--"
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.89,0:21:29.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们订了八点的位置\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Honey, we have to go. Our reservations are at 8.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.98,0:21:33.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,"以《我们订了八点的位置》得奖  作词人是尼尔赛门\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}"--In Reservations at Eight by Neil Simon.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.78,0:21:37.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢你  尼尔  谢谢你帮我填词"\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Thank you, Neil. Thank you for the words."
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.16,0:21:40.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好  待会再玩  我们要迟到了  我们得走了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay honey, You can finish this later. We're gonna be late. We gotta go.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.07,0:21:43.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,请不要奏乐  还有一件事\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Please don't play the music. Just one more thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.58,0:21:44.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}0Kay
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.79,0:21:48.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,"纽约现场直播  欢迎收看《周末夜现场》"\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}"Live from New York, it's Saturday Night!"
